      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Limnophilaaquatica(046TC)/30333",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Type:</strong> Stem plant</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> Asia</li><li><strong>Height:</strong> 20 - 30+ cm</li><li><strong>Light demand:</strong> Medium</li><li><strong>CO2:</strong> Low</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "maintenance",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Limnophilaaquatica(046TC)/30333",
      "html": "<p>In the right growing conditions with added CO2 and a nutritious bottom this plant grows fast and can become 25-50 cm long and each stem up to 15 cm wide. In good light it forms horizontal side shoots and becomes attractive and bushy.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Limnophilaaquatica(046TC)/30333",
      "html": "<p>An extremely beautiful aquarium plant from South-East Asia, circled by light-green and finely branched leaves. Most decorative when several stems are planted in a small group. In open aquariums it sometimes sends shoots above the water surface, forming small blue flowers.</p>"
    }
  ],
